    "diagnosis": "Two independent, now-understood problems, not a single mystery: (a) transient network stalls fetching very large blobs from this repo on this connection (resolved on retry -- attempt 4's trimmed 10-file fetch completed in 2m36s); (b) a GLiNER library behavior where from_pretrained(local_files_only=True) requires the CACHED snapshot to contain every file the repo publishes, not just the files inference reads, so a deliberately-trimmed cache (done specifically to avoid re-downloading a 1.27GB optimizer checkpoint never used for inference) is rejected as incomplete.",
